[4.427899, "o", "# Public FDA Label Data\r\n\r\nThis directory contains only public task inputs for `fda-hard-long-label-retrieval`.\r\n\r\n- `labels.jsonl` has full FDA label rows with `label_raw` and `chunks`.\r\n- `questions.jsonl` has 8 public questions.\r\n- Gold answers, references, citations, and curated context are not included here.\r\n\r\nLabels included:\r\n- Paxlovid (`8a99d6d6-fd9e-45bb-b1bf-48c7f761232a`)\r\n"]
