 ritonavir\r\n158: 0069-5045-30\r\n159: 0069-5321-30\r\n160: 0069-5045-06\r\n161: 0069-5321-03\r\n162: 150 mg nirmatrelvir; 100 mg ritonavir\r\n163: 0069-5317-20\r\n164: 0069-5434-20\r\n165: 0069-5317-02\r\n166: 0069-5434-02\r\n167: 0069-0521-11\r\n168: 0069-5450-11\r\n169: 0069-0521-11\r\n170: 0069-5450-11\r\n171: Storage and Handling\r\n172: 17 PATIENT COUNSELING INFORMATION\r\n173: Drug Interactions\r\n174: Hypersensitivity Reactions\r\n175: Moderate Renal Impairment\r\n176: Administration Instructions\r\n177: This product’s labeling may have been updated. For the most recent prescribing information, please visit www.pfizer.com.\r\n178: PATIENT INFORMATION\r\n179: How should I take PAXLOVID?\r\n180: Figure A\r\n181: Figure B\r\n182: Figure C\r\n183: 1 white ritonavir tablet together\r\n184: How should I store PAXLOVID?\r\n185: NDC 0069-5045-06\r\n186: Rx only\r\n187: PfizerNDC 0069-5045-30\r\n188: 300 mg; 100 mg Dose Pack\r\n189: NDC 0069-5321-03\r\n190: Rx only\r\n191: PfizerNDC 0069-5321-30\r\n192: 300 mg; 100 mg Dose Pack\r\n193: Take these 2 tabletstogether\r\n194: ritonavirtablet(100 mg)\r\n195: PfizerNDC 0069-5317-20\r\n196: 150 mg; 100 mg Dose Pack\r\n197: Day 1 (300 mg; 100 mg)Your first day’s dose. Take these 3 tablets together\r\n198: nirmatrelvirtablet(150 mg)nirmatrelvirtablet(150 mg)ritonavirtablet(100 mg)\r\n199: PAA228321\r\n200: PfizerNDC 0069-0521-11\r\n201: Take these 2 tabletstogether\r\n202: ritonavirtablet(100 mg)\r\n203: PfizerNDC 0069-5434-20\r\n204: 150 mg; 100 mg Dose Pack\r\n205: Day 1 (300 mg; 100 mg)Your first day’s dose. Take these 3 tablets together\r\n206: nirmatrelvirtablet(150 mg)nirmatrelvirtablet(150 mg)ritonavirtablet(100 mg)\r\n207: PAA228417\r\n208: PfizerNDC 0069-5450-11\r\n\u001b[?2004h"]
