[237.21512, "o", "      \"answer\": \"Safety risks listed for PAXLOVID include: 1) Serious adverse reactions (some fatal) due to drug-drug interactions involving CYP3A inhibition or induction; 2) Serious hypersensitivity reactions such as anaphylaxis, toxic epidermal necrolysis, and Stevens-Johnson syndrome; 3) Hepatotoxicity, including hepatic transaminase elevations, clinical hepatitis, and jaundice; and 4) Risk of HIV-1 resistance development in patients with uncontrolled or undiagnosed HIV-1 infection.\",\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
